#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/storyboard_docker.rst:163
msgid "Deleting Scenes"
msgstr "Brisanje prizorov"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/storyboard_docker.rst:163
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Deleting scene in storyboard does not delete the keyframes at the scene's "
"frame. Instead the duration of the deleted scene gets added to the previous "
"scene. This is prevent accidental data loss upon removing a scene."
msgstr ""
"Brisanje prizora v storyboardu ne izbriše ključnih okvirjev v okvirju "
"prizora. Namesto tega se trajanje izbrisanega prizora doda prejšnjem "
"prizoru. To preprečuje naključno izgubo podatkov ob odstranitvi prizora."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/storyboard_docker.rst:166
msgid "Reordering Scenes"
msgstr "Prerazvrščanje prizorov"

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/storyboard_docker.rst:166
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Scenes can be reordered using drag and drop. All the keyframes within the "
"duration of that scene will move upon reordering."
msgstr ""
"Prizori se lahko ponovno preuredijo z uporabo povlecite in spustite. Vsi "
"ključni okvirji v trajanju tega prizora se bodo premikali po preusmerjanju."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/storyboard_docker.rst:169
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The storyboard docker allows for the management of multiple optional comment "
"fields. While some projects might require only one comment field for dialog "
"per scene, some might require additional fields that describe character "
"actions or camera directions. The :ref:`Comment menu "
"<storyboard_comment_menu>` allows the user to configure these comment fields."
msgstr ""
"Docker storyboard omogoča upravljanje več izbirnih polj za komentarje. "
"Nekateri projekti morda zahtevajo samo eno polje pripomb za pogovorno okno "
"na prizor, nekateri pa morda zahtevajo dodatna polja, ki opisujejo dejanja "
"znakov ali usmeritve kamere. Meni :ref:'Comment ' omogoča uporabniku "
"konfiguriranje <storyboard_comment_menu>teh polj za komentarje."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/storyboard_docker.rst:171
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"To make a new comment field, go to :ref:`Comment menu "
"<storyboard_comment_menu>` and click on the plus button at the bottom-left. "
"A new comment field will be added to the menu. Change its name and press :"
"kbd:`Enter`. Every scene will now have the new comment field available to "
"edit."
msgstr ""
"Če želite ustvariti novo polje komentarja, pojdite na :ref:'Comment menu "
"<storyboard_comment_menu>' in kliknite gumb plus v spodnjem levem kotu. V "
"meni bo dodano novo polje za pripombe. Spremenite njegovo ime in pritisnite :"
"kbd:'Enter'. Vsak prizor bo imel zdaj na voljo novo polje za komentarje za "
"urejanje."

#: ../../reference_manual/dockers/storyboard_docker.rst:172
